    "text": "2 days ago WARREN — Brett Clingan, 54, passed away Thursday, Jan. 29, 2026, at Louis Stokes VA Medical Center. He was born June 8, 1971, in Cleveland, the son of Robert Clingan and Linda Olsen Clingan. Brett was a retired Army veteran. Prior to his disability, he enjoyed gardening and handcycling... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
